---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: languages
  size: 1
  alias: language
permalink: "{{ '/meld-fra/' | localeUrl(language.code) }}"
bodyClass: page-report
scripts:
  - /assets/js/report.js
eleventyComputed:
  name: "{{ t.report.pageTitle }}"
  description: "{{ t.report.pageDescription }}"
---
{#- «Meld fra» on a general level, from the menu: a new flying site, an error on the site, an idea or anything else. The
    same form as on the site pages (macros.njk reportForm, report.js); it becomes an issue for the club. A report about
    one site is better made on that site's page, which the intro says. -#}
{%- import "macros.njk" as m with context -%}
<main class="simple-page report-page">
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="back-link" href="{{ '/' | localeUrl }}">{{ m.chevron("left") }}{{ t.common.allSites }}</a>
    {{ m.siteMenu() }}
  </header>

  <div class="simple-page__intro" id="content" tabindex="-1">
    <p class="home__eyebrow">{{ t.home.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1>{{ t.report.pageTitle }}</h1>
    <p class="muted">{{ t.report.pageIntro }}</p>
  </div>

  {% if site.turnstileSiteKey %}
  <section class="block report" id="report" data-url="{{ site.reportUrl }}" data-sitekey="{{ site.turnstileSiteKey }}" data-site="" aria-label="{{ t.report.pageTitle }}">
    {{ m.reportForm(["newsite", "bug", "idea", "other"], t.report.messageGeneral) }}
    <noscript><p>{{ t.report.noScript }}</p></noscript>
  </section>
  {% else %}
  <p>{{ t.report.notReady }}</p>
  {% endif %}
</main>
